OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian surgeon was ready to 
OL,4,Aoperate on patient while recovering    
OL,5,Afrom medical procedure                 
OL,7,FAn NHS Grampian surgeon attempted to   
OL,8,Ftake over a knee operation while he was
OL,9,Frecovering from a medical procedure and
OL,10,Funder the influence of drugs, the BBC  
OL,11,Fhas learned.                           
OL,13,FThe doctor, who had to be driven to Dr 
OL,14,FGray's hospital in Elgin, allegedly    
OL,15,Ftried to step in because a colleague   
OL,16,Ffelt unable to complete the surgery.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
