OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian surgeon was ready to 
OL,4,Aoperate on patient while recovering    
OL,5,Afrom medical procedure                 
OL,7,FIn a separate incident, it is alleged a
OL,8,Fsurgeon had a physical altercation with
OL,9,Fa registrar who it is claimed suggested
OL,10,Fthey were about to replace the wrong   
OL,11,Fhip of a patient who was lying         
OL,12,Funconscious on the operating table.    
OL,14,FNHS Grampian said both matters were    
OL,15,Faddressed at the time through the      
OL,16,Fappropriate governance and employment  
OL,17,Fprocesses, and immediate action had    
OL,18,Fbeen taken.                            
